WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:03.602
A boy. I've just heard.

00:00:03.669 --> 00:00:04.603
Yes.

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:05.705
Well done.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:07.907
Where are you going?

00:00:08.073 --> 00:00:09.742
She wants to see him.

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:11.177
Now?

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:13.345
(SIGHS) I'm coming with you.

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:14.613
I should hope so.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:15.381
Let me take him.

00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:17.349
No, she'll get no such
satisfaction from that.

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:19.552
Just take my arm,
at the least.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.825
Was it terribly painful?

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:27.726
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:29.262
Oh, gods...

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:35.769
I took a lance
through the shoulder once.

00:00:37.069 --> 00:00:38.871
RHAENYRA TARGARYEN:
My deepest sympathies.

00:00:39.238 --> 00:00:41.007
-Princess.
-Princess.

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:43.143
LAENOR VELARYON:
I am glad I am not a woman.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:51.050
-(PAINED GRUNTS)
-(LABORED BREATHS)

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:52.352
What is it?

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:53.253
(BELLS CHIME)

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:54.821
What is it? What is it?

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:56.756
Fuck.

00:00:57.423 --> 00:00:59.592
Walk. Walk.

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:06.633
What could she possibly want?

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:10.503
I thought we were past this.

